Hello NTE team,

A new partner or sponsor expression of interest is ready for qualification. The prospect has not selected a priced package or supplied billing details at this stage.

Next steps

• Review organisational fit and the comments provided.

• Assign an owner and contact the prospect using their preference below.

• Share the sales brochure or webinar details where appropriate.

• Record the qualification outcome and next follow-up date in Salesforce.

